# Care as buffs (data/care.json): food and mood bars with a small tick at 70; above it they light up
# (brighter fill, a tiny sparkle, the buff's name as tooltip) and give full tummy (coins x1.2) and
# happy (luck x1.1) as `care` boost parts. A snack costs 3 capsules' worth. Home card and corner panel.
from after_tutorial
view full
tab home
wait 1
expect fits
care 40 40
wait 1
shot plain
boosts                                # no care parts
coins 100
click "feed*"
wait 1
shot fed                              # food 70: on the tick, not lit yet
click "feed*"
wait 1
shot full                             # food 100: lit, sparkle
care 90 90
wait 1
shot both
boosts                                # care full_tummy x1.200 (coins), care happy x1.100 (luck)
view corner
wait 1
shot corner
care 40 40
wait 1
shot corner_plain
view full
expect fits
